# Ignore everything by default: only config is tracked.
# Whitelist approach means new transcripts, caches, and any future secrets
# are ignored automatically; nothing is committed unless explicitly allowed below.
*

!.gitignore
!CLAUDE.md

# Skills are whitelisted individually; a new skill stays local until added here.
!skills/
skills/*
!skills/adhd/
!skills/adhd/**
!skills/bro/
!skills/bro/**
!skills/clean/
!skills/clean/**
!skills/codex/
!skills/codex/**
!skills/deslop/
!skills/deslop/**
!skills/slice/
!skills/slice/**
!skills/spec/
!skills/spec/**
